1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Palendrolar.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Child.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The pool reached the port at Hillsfar.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Can you hear the screams?

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Something troubles you.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Speak.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
They are not fools.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
They will send their heroes.

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
They will meet the Mythal, our Mythal, and
then they will meet you.

10
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:53,800
The cult of the dragon? 
This is worse than we ever imagined. 
She must be stopped. But how?

11
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,820
Our heroes must seize 
the power of the Mythal for themselves.

12
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:07,720
Otherwise, the moon sees lost, 
and the dragon reach, and with them, 
all our hopes.
